WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:01,780
Otherwise

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:02,920
You quote a price

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,720
If I think it's appropriate, you can take it.

4
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:08,090
Let’s not say how much a pound costs either.

5
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:11,330
How about I take it for a flat price of 400 yuan?

6
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,050
Fifty pounds of discouraged sand

7
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,050
Four hundred yuan is eight yuan per pound.

8
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:20,060
This price is quite good

9
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,340
Boss Jin is refreshing

10
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,260
Sure enough, you still have to do business with rich people.

11
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,100
People are rich

12
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:27,780
Show a little between your fingers

13
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:34,560
It’s enough for me, brother

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,120
Do you know how to cut shark fins?

15
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,100
I'm the best at this job

16
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,620
Then please help me, brother

17
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,260
Take this discouraged shark fin

18
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,420
Can you cut them all off?

19
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:47,860
When I treat someone to dinner, I only need the shark fins and not the meat.

20
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,540
Just think of it as your wages.

21
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:52,650
What kind of twenty group is this?

22
00:00:53,010 --> 00:00:54,410
I bought discouraged sand at a high price

23
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:56,050
But I only want shark fins and not meat.

24
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:58,870
I used to wonder about the fish weighing over fifty kilograms

25
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:00,150
Why only cook one dish?

26
00:01:00,570 --> 00:01:02,210
If you're in love, you need a shark's fin.
